# For the script refusals-rebel: entries of the Commands menu that the game refuses.
# May 1862, the Rebels play. They have too little cash for a fort (200) or to move the capital
# (500).
date 5 1862
side 2
cash 300 150
# Two Rebel armies. J.E. Johnston in Richmond is too small to detach from (under 6,500) and too
# experienced to drill (above 5), and has a day of supplies, so it is short of them. Jackson
# in Front Royal can drill. His 40,000 men have no supplies: four days of them cost 160, so
# buying them spends all the cash.
army 21 size=40 exp=6 supply=1
army 22 exp=1 size=400 supply=0
noarmy 23 24
